Package: CSRcalculator
Type: Package
Title: Calculation and Assignment of CSR Plant Strategies Using Multiple Models
Version: 0.1.2
Author: Teddy Gaskin
Maintainer: Teddy Gaskin <teddygaskin@gmail.com>
Description: Provides functions to calculate and assign plant strategies based on the CSR framework (competitor, stress-tolerator, ruderal), using three models: StrateFy (Pierce et al. 2017), the morphophysiological model (Novakovskiy et al. 2016), and Hodgson et al.'s (1999) original model.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: dplyr
Suggests: roxygen2, devtools
